        "location": "docs/pipeline-improvement-research-2026-11-11.md:357",
        "text": "- **R4 — Anthropic, Effective harnesses for long-running agents (2025)**：[原文](https://www.anthropic.com/research/effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents)。参考价值：环境初始化、逐功能进展、结构化交接产物及可恢复状态。适用 13、36、47；跨模型适用性需自行验证。"
      },
      {
        "location": "docs/pipeline-improvement-research-2026-11-11.md:358",
        "text": "- **R5 — Anthropic, Demystifying evals for AI agents (2026)**：[原文](https://www.anthropic.com/research/demystifying-evals-for-ai-agents)。参考价值：多次试验、结果与轨迹、多类判分、能力与回归评测分开。适用 08、24、52；本文具体重复次数与统计表是项目建议。"
